  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 350°F (180°C).",
    "Line a 9x9-inch baking dish with parchment paper.",
    "In a large bowl, cream together almond paste, butter, and honey until smooth.",
    "Add ground almonds, vanilla extract, baking powder, and salt. Mix until well combined.",
    "Pour in coconut oil and mix until a dough forms.",
    "Roll out the dough between two sheets of parchment paper to a thickness of 1/4 inch.",
    "Transfer the dough to the prepared baking dish and smooth the top.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes or until the edges are golden brown.",
    "Remove from the oven and sprinkle with chopped pecans, confectioners' sugar, and coconut flakes.",
    "Let cool completely before serving."
  ],
